<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-YIELDS MIXED AT TREASURY BILL AUCTION.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-YIELDS MIXED AT TREASURY BILL AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yield on Latvian T-bills with</p>
<p>three and twelve-month maturities fell at Wednesday's auction</p>
<p>and 28-day paper was slightly up, the finance ministry.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD(pct)  LAST  NO OF BANKS    ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> One month    4.12	  4.06	 2	    0.5   0.7  0.5</p>
<p> Three-month  4.67	  5.13	 5	    1.0   1.3  1.0</p>
<p> Twelve-month 7.46	  8.20	13	   10.0  23.3 10.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
